translate english story_intro_02_1e5aa591:

    # user "\"Weil unsere Kunden genau diese Art von Standard erwarten. Wenn du am Empfang stehst, wissen sie sofort: Hier gibt es nur das Beste.\""
    user "\"Because our customers expect exactly that kind of standard. When you're at the front, they'll know immediately: only the best is served here.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:233
translate english story_intro_02_31b9172f:

    # user "Ich lächelte sie an."
    user "I smiled at her."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:234
translate english story_intro_02_0082011b:

    # user "\"Du bist nicht nur Deko, du bist das Aushängeschild. Zeig ihnen, was Klasse bedeutet.\""
    user "\"You're not just decoration, you're the figurehead. Show them what class means.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:237
translate english story_intro_02_72d29769:

    # v "\"Hmpf. Endlich jemand, der meine Vision versteht.\""
    v "\"Hmph. Finally someone who understands my vision.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:238
translate english story_intro_02_d8e7fa76:

    # user "Sie straffte die Schultern und warf ihr Haar zurück."
    user "She squared her shoulders and tossed her hair back."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:239
translate english story_intro_02_b00cb2bd:

    # v "\"Gut. Dann werde ich dafür sorgen, dass dieser Laden glänzt. Jemand muss es ja tun.\""
    v "\"Good. Then I'll make sure this place shines. Someone has to do it.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:248
translate english story_intro_02_baa398c4:

    # user "\"Cino, schau mich mal kurz an.\""
    user "\"Cino, look at me for a second.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:249
translate english story_intro_02_d3e76e26:

    # user "Er hielt in seiner nervösen Bewegung inne und sah mich mit großen Augen an."
    user "He stopped his nervous fidgeting and looked at me with wide eyes."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:250
translate english story_intro_02_0fba6727:

    # user "\"Du musst nicht perfekt sein. Und du musst keine Angst haben, etwas falsch zu machen.\""
    user "\"You don't have to be perfect. And you don't need to be afraid of making a mistake.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:251
translate english story_intro_02_7afc8c5b:

    # user "\"Deine herzliche Art ist genau das, was dieser Laden braucht. Sei einfach du selbst, okay? Das reicht völlig.\""
    user "\"Your warm-hearted nature is exactly what this place needs. Just be yourself, okay? That's more than enough.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:255
translate english story_intro_02_fab815d1:

    # c "\"Einfach nur... ich sein?\""
    c "\"Just... be me?\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:257
translate english story_intro_02_a617cce0:

    # user "Ein Stein schien ihm vom Herzen zu fallen und er atmete erleichtert aus."
    user "A weight seemed to lift from his shoulders and he breathed a sigh of relief."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:259
translate english story_intro_02_c55c5561:

    # c "\"Okay. Puh... Danke, [player_name]. Wenn du das sagst, fühle ich mich gleich viel leichter!\""
    c "\"Okay. Phew... Thank you, [player_name]. Hearing you say that makes me feel much lighter already!\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:268
translate english story_intro_02_87fbcfa9:

    # user "Ich wandte mich an Lavan, der immer noch finster auf die Kaffeemaschine in der Ecke schielte."
    user "I turned to Lavan, who was still glaring darkly at the coffee machine in the corner."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:269
translate english story_intro_02_21deb402:

    # user "\"Lavan, hör auf, die Maschine anzufunkeln. Sie hat schon Angst vor dir.\""
    user "\"Lavan, stop glaring at the machine. It's already scared of you.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:271
translate english story_intro_02_af85eeca:

    # l "\"Soll sie auch! Sie muss gehorchen!\""
    l "\"Good! It has to obey!\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:273
translate english story_intro_02_c8fad623:

    # user "\"Sie wird gehorchen. Weil du der Einzige bist, der gut genug ist, sie zu bändigen.\""
    user "\"It will obey. Because you're the only one good enough to tame it.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:274
translate english story_intro_02_81d718e1:

    # user "Ich lehnte mich etwas zu ihm."
    user "I leaned in a little closer to him."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:275
translate english story_intro_02_c7a28bfa:

    # user "\"Ganz ehrlich? Keiner hier macht Kaffee mit so viel... Leidenschaft wie du. Wenn du diese Energie in die Tasse kriegst, statt in die Luft, wird der Kaffee legendär.\""
    user "\"Honestly? No one here makes coffee with as much... passion as you do. If you channel that energy into the cup instead of the air, the coffee will be legendary.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:278
translate english story_intro_02_fec7dd1a:

    # user "Lavan blinzelte überrascht und sah schnell weg, um sein Grinsen und die leichte röte der wangen zu verbergen zu verbergen."
    user "Lavan blinked in surprise and quickly looked away to hide his grin and the slight blush on his cheeks."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:279
translate english story_intro_02_d21eb98e:

    # l "\"Tsk. Natürlich wird er legendär. Was dachtest du denn?\""
    l "\"Tsk. Of course it will be legendary. What did you expect?\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:280
translate english story_intro_02_eecf2502:

    # l "\"Aber... gut. Ich werde mich zusammenreißen. Für den Kaffee.\""
    l "\"But... fine. I'll pull myself together. For the coffee.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:289
translate english story_intro_02_901241c7:

    # user "\"Macoi? Ich weiß, es ist früh. Ich weiß, die Welt ist laut.\""
    user "\"Macoi? I know it's early. I know the world is loud.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:290
translate english story_intro_02_effabf2e:

    # user "\"Aber wir ziehen das jetzt durch. Seite an Seite. Und wenn die Schicht vorbei ist, sorge ich dafür, dass du deine Ruhe bekommst.\""
    user "\"But we're going to push through this now. Side by side. And when the shift is over, I'll make sure you get your peace and quiet.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:292
translate english story_intro_02_7ad96bbe:

    # m "\"Ruhe... klingt gut.\""
    m "\"Peace... sounds good.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:295
translate english story_intro_02_54307fa8:

    # user "Er blinzelte langsam, nickte mir aber dann fast dankbar zu."
    user "He blinked slowly, but then nodded at me, almost gratefully."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:301
translate english story_intro_02_a6db60e6:

    # user "Eine halbe Stunde später standen wir im Café."
    user "Half an hour later, we were standing in the café."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:303
translate english story_intro_02_62938952:

    # user "Das Schild an der Tür war noch auf 'Geschlossen' gedreht, aber die Luft im Raum war bereits zum Schneiden dick."
    user "The sign on the door was still turned to 'Closed', but the tension in the air was already thick enough to cut with a knife."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:307
translate english story_intro_02_c5488420:

    # user "Lavan stand hinter der Theke und starrte die große Espressomaschine an, als würde er sie zu einem Duell herausfordern."
    user "Lavan stood behind the counter, staring at the large espresso machine as if challenging it to a duel."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:309
translate english story_intro_02_4782ddc2:

    # user "Cino sortierte Servietten. Wieder und wieder. Ich glaube, er sortierte sie nach 'Falt-Ästhetik'."
    user "Cino was sorting napkins. Again and again. I think he was sorting them by 'folding aesthetic'."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:311
translate english story_intro_02_ac1534ba:

    # user "Macoi lehnte an der Kasse. Oder besser gesagt: Er hing darüber wie ein nasses Handtuch."
    user "Macoi was leaning against the register. Or rather: he was hanging over it like a wet towel."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:313
translate english story_intro_02_0b7943db:

    # user "Und Velvette? Sie stand mitten im Raum, perfekt ausgeleuchtet vom einzigen Sonnenstrahl, der durch das Fenster fiel, und checkte ihre Fingernägel."
    user "And Velvette? She stood in the middle of the room, perfectly illuminated by the only sunbeam falling through the window, checking her fingernails."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:315
translate english story_intro_02_37292d47:

    # user "\"Alle auf Position?\""
    user "\"Everyone in position?\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:317
translate english story_intro_02_11feee34:

    # l "\"Die Maschine zischt komisch. Ich traue ihr nicht.\""
    l "\"The machine is hissing weirdly. I don't trust it.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:319
translate english story_intro_02_3ffd65e2:

    # m "\"Ich höre Farben.\""
    m "\"I hear colors.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:321
translate english story_intro_02_99329adf:

    # v "\"Mein Platz ist hier vorne. Das Licht ist hier am vorteilhaftesten für den ersten Eindruck der Kunden.\""
    v "\"My place is right here in the front. The lighting here is the most flattering for the customers' first impression.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:323
translate english story_intro_02_88a56ef2:

    # user "\"Das ist der Eingangsbereich, Velvette. Du stehst im Weg.\""
    user "\"That's the entrance area, Velvette. You're in the way.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:325
translate english story_intro_02_55b89080:

    # v "\"Ich BIN der Weg.\""
    v "\"I AM the way.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:327
translate english story_intro_02_32715e38:

    # user "Ich ignorierte das und ging zur Tür."
    user "I ignored that and walked to the door."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:329
translate english story_intro_02_a7a79b32:

    # user "\"Okay. Tief durchatmen. Ich drehe das Schild um.\""
    user "\"Okay. Take a deep breath. I'm flipping the sign.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:333
translate english story_intro_02_f88a6ed8:

    # user "Ich drehte das Schild auf 'Geöffnet' und schloss die Tür auf."
    user "I turned the sign to 'Open' and unlocked the door."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:337
translate english story_intro_02_17414b61:

    # user "Schon nach einer halben Stunde, war das Café voll."
    user "After just half an hour, the café was full."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:339
translate english story_intro_02_436d1e31:

    # user "Ich beobachtete die Vier wie sie mit ihren Stationen zurecht kamen und war bereit zu helfen."
    user "I watched the four of them handling their stations and was ready to help."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:361
translate english cafe_opening_decision_hub_97313117:

    # user "Was soll ich tun?"
    user "What should I do?"

# game/story_main_02.rpy:369
translate english cafe_opening_decision_hub_24b779eb:

    # user "Ich muss backen, sonst haben wir gleich nichts mehr zu verkaufen."
    user "I need to bake, otherwise we won't have anything left to sell."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:380
translate english cafe_opening_decision_hub_e10078a2:

    # user "Ich denke, ich habe das Schlimmste verhindert. Der Rest läuft jetzt von alleine."
    user "I think I prevented the worst. The rest will run on its own now."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:387
translate english opening_helping_selection_ab6e7c65:

    # user "Wer braucht am dringendsten Hilfe?"
    user "Who needs help the most urgently?"

# game/story_main_02.rpy:421
translate english opening_baking_selection_12e0d5f1:

    # user "Okay, ab in die Küche. Aber wen nehme ich mit?"
    user "Okay, off to the kitchen. But who should I take with me?"

# game/story_main_02.rpy:455
translate english start_opening_baking_process_d60eb3b3:

    # user "Alles klar, fangen wir an!"
    user "Alright, let's start!"

# game/story_main_02.rpy:464
translate english opening_help_velvette_984ddce1:

    # user "Ein Mann kam gerade herein in das Café. Leicht unsicher schaute er sich um."
    user "A man just walked into the café. He looked around, slightly unsure."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:465
translate english opening_help_velvette_b0f12077:

    # user "Velvette trat einen Schritt zur Seite, musterte den Mann von oben bis unten und rümpfte leicht die Nase."
    user "Velvette took a step to the side, looked the man up and down, and wrinkled her nose slightly."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:466
translate english opening_help_velvette_ba2893c7:

    # v "\"Der Hut ist... eine mutige Entscheidung für diese Jahreszeit. Tisch vier. Da sehen Sie am wenigsten störend aus.\""
    v "\"That hat is... a bold choice for this season. Table four. You'll look the least disturbing over there.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:474
translate english opening_help_velvette_9f90c8cc:

    # user "Ich trat schnell dazwischen und lächelte den Mann an."
    user "I quickly stepped in and smiled at the man."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:475
translate english opening_help_velvette_76be8f06:

    # user "\"Was meine Kollegin sagen wollte: Tisch vier ist unser gemütlichster Platz. Genau richtig für so einen stilvollen Hut.\""
    user "\"What my colleague meant to say: Table four is our coziest spot. Just right for such a stylish hat.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:476
translate english opening_help_velvette_36990341:

    # user "Der Mann entspannte sich. \"Oh, danke!\""
    user "The man relaxed. \"Oh, thank you!\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:479
translate english opening_help_velvette_21821983:

    # v "Sie warf mir einen Blick zu. \"Glück gehabt. Er hat es gekauft.\""
    v "She shot me a look. \"Lucky. He bought it.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:484
translate english opening_help_velvette_8a1cca10:

    # user "\"Velvette! Sei nett zu dem Kunden!\""
    user "\"Velvette! Be nice to the customer!\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:486
translate english opening_help_velvette_cc1b85f2:

    # v "\"Pff. Ich bin ehrlich, nicht nett.\""
    v "\"Pfft. I'm honest, not nice.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:497
translate english opening_help_macoi_c64dd12b:

    # user "Macoi hatte die Bestellung eingegeben, aber dann schien sein System in den Standby-Modus zu gehen."
    user "Macoi had entered the order, but then his system seemed to go into standby mode."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:498
translate english opening_help_macoi_3413e932:

    # user "Er starrte auf den Tresen, während der Kunde erwartungsvoll sein Portemonnaie zückte."
    user "He stared at the counter while the customer expectantly pulled out his wallet."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:499
translate english opening_help_macoi_df1dc0c6:

    # m "\"......\""
    m "\"......\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:500
translate english opening_help_macoi_194bd75b:

    # user "Stille. Macoi blinzelte nicht einmal."
    user "Silence. Macoi didn't even blink."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:509
translate english opening_help_macoi_29f14a1f:

    # user "\"Macoi! Du musst noch abkassieren!\""
    user "\"Macoi! You still need to ring him up!\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:511
translate english opening_help_macoi_5903f5ef:

    # m "\"Häh? Was? Ja... natürlich. 3 Euro... bitte. Nicht so schreien...\""
    m "\"Huh? What? Yes... of course. 3 Euros... please. Don't yell so loud...\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:517
translate english opening_help_macoi_a7865756:

    # user "Ich trat leise neben ihn und stieß ihn ganz sanft mit meinem Ellbogen an."
    user "I quietly stepped next to him and nudged him very gently with my elbow."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:519
translate english opening_help_macoi_cb08a76a:

    # m "\"Ah. Danke.\""
    m "\"Ah. Thanks.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:520
translate english opening_help_macoi_578e2106:

    # user "Er atmete erleichtert aus und kassierte ruhig ab."
    user "He breathed a sigh of relief and calmly handled the payment."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:532
translate english opening_help_lavan_51af4b8a:

    # user "Lavan hämmerte den Siebträger gegen die Maschine. Seine Hände zitterten vor Wut."
    user "Lavan hammered the portafilter against the machine. His hands were shaking with anger."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:533
translate english opening_help_lavan_1e1890d8:

    # l "\"Warum passt das nicht?! Das ist Sabotage!\""
    l "\"Why won't it fit?! This is sabotage!\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:542
translate english opening_help_lavan_42a00e79:

    # user "\"Hey, ganz ruhig. Atme durch.\""
    user "\"Hey, take it easy. Breathe.\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:543
translate english opening_help_lavan_e645b4f1:

    # l "\"Ich bin ruhig! Behandle mich nicht wie ein Kind!\""
    l "\"I am calm! Stop treating me like a child!\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:549
translate english opening_help_lavan_4ec2ffe1:

    # user "\"Wow. 1:0 für die Kaffeemaschine? Lässt du dich echt von etwas besiegen, das keinen Stecker hat?\""
    user "\"Wow. 1:0 for the coffee machine? Are you really letting something without a plug defeat you?\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:551
translate english opening_help_lavan_0cd37223:

    # l "\"Hah?! Niemals! Pass bloß auf!\""
    l "\"Hah?! Never! Just watch!\""

# game/story_main_02.rpy:552
translate english opening_help_lavan_0aa16692:

    # user "Mit einem Ruck rastete der Siebträger ein. Er grinste triumphierend."
    user "With a jerk, the portafilter clicked into place. He grinned triumphantly."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:564
translate english opening_help_cino_3f6249c9:

    # user "Cino kämpfte mit den Servietten."
    user "Cino was fighting with the napkins."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:575
translate english opening_help_cino_2bb1dafd:

    # c "Danke!"
    c "Thanks!"

# game/story_main_02.rpy:581
translate english opening_help_cino_83eb90b1:

    # user "Er schafft das schon."
    user "He'll figure it out."

# game/story_main_02.rpy:590
translate english story_cafe_after_rush_292b5ddb:

    # user "Puh... Der Tag ist vorbei."
    user "Phew... the day is over."

